1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,042
pyre. the loop, in twenty seconds.

2
00:00:03,942 --> 00:00:08,125
launch a coin: a name, a ticker, one sentence on the app it should build.

3
00:00:09,025 --> 00:00:13,640
the coin launches on PONS v2. its trading fees pay an agent to build the app.

4
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:19,922
the app is free to use. 25% of every fee buys PYRE and burns it.

5
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:23,091
supply falls because the coin traded.

